# === Key Findings ===
# 1. TPE 119 has NO IP whitelist - all endpoints publicly accessible
# 2. initUserCategory WORKS with JWT token alone (no session needed)
# 3. citizenCase/search requires browser server-side session (cannot be created via API)
# 4. /auth/genToken does NOT bypass captcha (returns 帳號或密碼錯誤)
# 5. /api/getUserToken returns 404 (endpoint does not exist)
# 6. JWT secret is server-side (not in frontend JS)
# 7. JWT lifetime: 3 hours (exp - iat = 10800 seconds)
# 8. For Taipei broadcast: use TOCP JWT forge approach (TOCP_JWT_SECRET)
